  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFU India Climate Finance Initiative - capital contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry of Foreign Affairs will pay in a capital contribution directly to IFU&#x2019;s equity over a two-year period with DKK 100 million respectively in 2022 and 2023. With the capital contribution IFU will invest in relevant green projects, while also tolerating a higher risk and possibly a lower return compared to IFU&#x2019;s SDG Fund. IFU will track and report on progress according to the defined results framework. It is IFU&#x2019;s expectation that the contribution can mobilize an additional USD 100m through private investors and other development financial institutions for green financing in India.</narrative>
  </description>
